## Next Steps

1. **Interim Meetings Planning:** The chairs and AD will organize virtual interim meeting(s) in January/February 2027 prior to IETF 128 (Kuala Lumpur) to evaluate high-level architectural requirements and drive convergence across competing protocol proposals.
2. **MDI & Protocol Boundaries:** Technical discussion on the mailing list will focus on defining:
   * The explicit boundary between initial DNS discovery and post-discovery HTTPS/`/.well-known` retrieval.
   * Trust models and integrity requirements (WebPKI vs. DNSSEC dependencies).
   * Exact parameters required for Minimum Discoverable Information (MDI).